{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master the arcane arts in <strong>Ritualist</strong> \u2014 a roguelike action game where every choice shapes your destiny. You are the last Ritualist, a blade against the creeping dark. Armed with forbidden knowledge and cursed steel, you must descend into dungeons, where every shadow hides teeth and every corridor twists with the weight of forgotten sins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/508d23f274c2c8dc186e2045a644eacd.poster.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/508d23f274c2c8dc186e2045a644eacd.webm?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/508d23f274c2c8dc186e2045a644eacd.mp4?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/e8e33e5f2ed565f69fb8606d308bc956.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1200 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARSENAL OF WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/9ddc5e9618b92edf33a5c46fe19433ec.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1200 height=477 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of unique weapons, each with distinct characteristics and attack mechanics. Each weapon offers a unique playstyle and synergizes differently with your build choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP BUILD CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/2d4bcad5bed1518610da766988e4a0ae.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1200 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build crafting in Ritualist revolves around complex interactions between game entities and systems based on <strong>runes and cards\u00a0</strong>and available character mechanics. Your build evolves as you progress through each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLLED CHAOS AND PROCEDURAL GENERATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/7a3a86e57f24f94152fc8ae8d3a4664d.poster.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/7a3a86e57f24f94152fc8ae8d3a4664d.webm?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/7a3a86e57f24f94152fc8ae8d3a4664d.mp4?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of randomness. While the world generates procedurally, <strong>you always have a choice</strong>. Explore new biomes and fight enemies, never repeate your last run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC COMBAT SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/696e56c0e74d0d47261004aef382c074.poster.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/696e56c0e74d0d47261004aef382c074.webm?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/696e56c0e74d0d47261004aef382c074.mp4?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult yet intelligent combat system presents death as not merely a setback, but a crucial mechanism for uncovering ancient knowledge necessary for progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE THE RITUAL OR DIE TRYING!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/ccba74401cffd7054fc7c812e1335b97.poster.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/ccba74401cffd7054fc7c812e1335b97.webm?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/ccba74401cffd7054fc7c812e1335b97.mp4?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/ef58c0f16c82e7ad6f1d00db03a80362.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1200 height=144 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3179460?t=1773055223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/6871b41cff9b24236465b32ac9af678cf5e06d09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773055223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/9bea0571d398ab15d8a985811487750d725ea21d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773055223","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/9bea0571d398ab15d8a985811487750d725ea21d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773055223","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descr