ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/e8e33e5f2ed565f69fb8606d308bc956.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1200 height=144 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARSENAL OF WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/9ddc5e9618b92edf33a5c46fe19433ec.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1200 height=477 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a diverse arsenal of unique weapons, each with distinct characteristics and attack mechanics. Each weapon offers a unique playstyle and synergizes differently with your build choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP BUILD CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/2d4bcad5bed1518610da766988e4a0ae.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1200 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build crafting in Ritualist revolves around complex interactions between game entities and systems based on <strong>runes and cards\u00a0</strong>and available character mechanics. Your build evolves as you progress through each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLLED CHAOS AND PROCEDURAL GENERATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/7a3a86e57f24f94152fc8ae8d3a4664d.poster.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/7a3a86e57f24f94152fc8ae8d3a4664d.webm?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/7a3a86e57f24f94152fc8ae8d3a4664d.mp4?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of randomness. While the world generates procedurally, <strong>you always have a choice</strong>. Explore new biomes and fight enemies, never repeate your last run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC COMBAT SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/696e56c0e74d0d47261004aef382c074.poster.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/696e56c0e74d0d47261004aef382c074.webm?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/696e56c0e74d0d47261004aef382c074.mp4?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult yet intelligent combat system presents death as not merely a setback, but a crucial mechanism for uncovering ancient knowledge necessary for progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE THE RITUAL OR DIE TRYING!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/ccba74401cffd7054fc7c812e1335b97.poster.avif?t=1773055223\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/ccba74401cffd7054fc7c812e1335b97.webm?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179460/extras/ccba74401cffd7054fc7c812e1335b97.mp4?t=1773055223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam